The Anderson Tapes is a crime, thriller, action film directed by Sidney Lumet.

3
00:17:28,235 --> 00:17:34,235
Thief Duke Anderson—just released from ten years in jail—takes up with his old girlfriend
in her posh apartment block, and makes plans to rob the entire building.

4
